       "en": "girls hide in distress."
      },
      {
       "cyr": "На чело стојат Груев, Сугарев,",
       "lat": "Na čelo stojat Gruev, Sugarev,",
       "en": "At the head stand Gruev and Sugarev,"
      },
      {
       "cyr": "верна дружина командувет.",
       "lat": "verna družina komanduvet.",
       "en": "the faithful band is commanded."
